WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.390
Oyama

00:04.520 --> 00:05.340
You've—

00:05.810 --> 00:08.190
Practice Questions

00:08.430 --> 00:10.220
You've already done them all.

00:10.220 --> 00:12.680
How?! How did you do that?!

00:12.680 --> 00:15.160
Huh? Oh, um...

00:15.160 --> 00:19.690
M-My sister tutored me
while I was absent from school...

00:20.500 --> 00:24.430
Oh, right. She's like a doctor
or something, right?

00:25.670 --> 00:26.660
Hm?

00:27.130 --> 00:30.210
Mahiro

00:27.330 --> 00:30.000
Hey, you two. I brought
you some refreshments!

00:30.000 --> 00:31.870
Thanks so much!

00:32.450 --> 00:35.640
You guys are doing homework? I'm so proud!

00:35.640 --> 00:39.480
Yeah, finals start next week.

00:39.480 --> 00:42.980
Oh, black tea! It smells so nice.

00:43.410 --> 00:46.810
Doesn't it? Try it with some cookies.

00:47.710 --> 00:49.270
Thank you!

00:53.430 --> 00:57.700
I hate math. Especially when they
start adding letters to it...

00:59.320 --> 01:00.370
Oh...

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Okay, take this question.

01:03.790 --> 01:08.270
Here, "x" is the cost of an orange, correct?

01:04.270 --> 01:07.790
I forgot it'd just be middle-
school-level homework.

01:07.790 --> 01:11.490
Even if it's been a while,
this kind of stuff's a breeze.

01:08.270 --> 01:10.410
So this is the equation here...

01:10.410 --> 01:13.160
Which means we can take this
number and carry it over here...

01:11.490 --> 01:12.710
With any luck...

01:13.160 --> 01:13.860
Okay...

01:13.360 --> 01:15.840
I'll be wiping the floor with all my exams!

01:13.860 --> 01:15.610
Now, add those two together.

01:15.610 --> 01:17.140
Then you just divide!

01:17.140 --> 01:19.310
Oh, I get it now!

01:35.610 --> 01:36.700
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

01:37.200 --> 01:38.320
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

01:40.490 --> 01:43.620
Mahiro Oyama

01:46.790 --> 01:49.830
Mihari Oyama

02:44.640 --> 02:53.020
ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister

02:53.480 --> 02:58.440
#07 Mahiro's Role-Playing Game

02:58.690 --> 03:02.180
Ugh, I hate tests.

03:02.590 --> 03:04.670
Must be nice, Mahiro-chan.

03:04.670 --> 03:06.710
Being such a smarty-pants!

03:08.260 --> 03:10.210
I dunno about that!

03:11.120 --> 03:12.950
It's Asahi and Miyo-chan!

03:13.510 --> 03:15.310
Good morning!

03:19.400 --> 03:22.880
What's happened to the bright
and bubbly Asahi I know?!

03:22.880 --> 03:25.990
Tests are her arch-nemesis.

03:27.680 --> 03:30.560
Ah, another victim of our
test-score-obsessed society.

03:31.580 --> 03:34.120
She reminds me of myself not too long ago.

03:35.390 --> 03:38.530
There, there. You'll get through it.

03:38.530 --> 03:40.780
I know exactly how you feel.

03:43.620 --> 03:48.010
Mahiron. We're gonna get through
makeup exams together, okay?!

03:48.010 --> 03:50.230
Wha?! Why me?!

03:51.210 --> 03:53.250
Don't you think you're jumping the gun?!

03:51.220 --> 03:53.250
Aren't you gonna separate them?

03:53.250 --> 03:55.750
Well, Asahi's having a bad day.

03:53.820 --> 03:57.500
We've got this, okay?!

03:55.750 --> 03:57.600
I'll let it slide just this once.

04:07.320 --> 04:13.130
I don't think I've ever felt this
calm before an exam in my life.

04:13.140 --> 04:15.310
Math

04:13.140 --> 04:15.310
Social Studies

04:13.140 --> 04:15.310
Science

04:13.650 --> 04:15.030
You may begin.

04:16.480 --> 04:18.820
Answer Sheet

04:23.530 --> 04:25.390
A perfect score would be too suspicious.

04:25.390 --> 04:27.580
I'll mess up a couple on purpose.

04:27.580 --> 04:30.230
All things in moderation, as they say!

04:32.890 --> 04:35.500
She's always dozing off.

04:35.500 --> 04:38.290
I'd feel bad if I let her
sleep through this, though.

04:38.760 --> 04:40.130
Poke, poke.

04:46.400 --> 04:48.180
I totally get it, though.

04:48.530 --> 04:53.050
These seats are so warm and cozy.

05:06.710 --> 05:08.270
All right, stop there!

05:08.270 --> 05:11.090
Pass your answer sheets
to the person in front!

05:14.610 --> 05:15.950
Huh?

05:17.420 --> 05:19.900
Answer Sheet

05:20.880 --> 05:21.970
Wait!

05:35.680 --> 05:38.650
I-It's over...

05:39.220 --> 05:40.380
All right!

05:40.380 --> 05:42.050
Time to make a comeback!

05:42.820 --> 05:45.740
Math 8:40-9:30

05:42.820 --> 05:45.740
Social Studies 9:40-10:30

05:42.820 --> 05:45.740
Science 10:40-11:30

05:42.820 --> 05:45.740
Japanese 11:40 AM-12:30

05:42.820 --> 05:45.740
English 13:20-14:10

05:45.750 --> 05:48.180
Huh? Which era?

05:48.590 --> 05:51.810
Vegetation? Wh-What's a stratum?!

05:52.100 --> 05:56.170
Ugh, I forgot all about
classical literature!

05:56.520 --> 05:57.070
Oh!

05:58.010 --> 05:59.890
I've got English in the bag.

06:04.600 --> 06:07.120
All right, I'll be handing
back your tests now.

06:07.340 --> 06:10.930
Ughhh...

06:07.790 --> 06:10.770
Ughhh...

06:11.550 --> 06:13.020
Mahiro-chan?

06:13.410 --> 06:14.980
Wh-What the—?!

06:14.980 --> 06:17.610
I <i>knew</i> I could count on you, Mahiron!

06:17.610 --> 06:20.680
I'll see you at the makeup exams, buddy!

06:20.680 --> 06:22.410
Don't forget me!

06:22.410 --> 06:24.970
I can help teach you!

06:26.860 --> 06:30.450
But honestly, I'm kind of relieved.

06:30.450 --> 06:33.960
I like you better this way, anyway.

06:36.320 --> 06:37.870
I should've known...

06:38.290 --> 06:42.150
What? You slept through math?!

06:42.150 --> 06:44.340
What a slob!

06:44.340 --> 06:46.510
That's classic Mahiro-chan,
though, don't you think?

06:46.510 --> 06:47.880
So true!

06:47.160 --> 06:49.860
I was getting stressed out over nothing.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.760
Silly girl!

06:55.460 --> 06:59.180
O-Okay, this is too much even for me...

06:59.180 --> 07:01.530
I don't mind being stupid,

07:01.530 --> 07:03.770
but it kinda sucks to fail
on the rote memorization.

07:04.110 --> 07:07.940
No gaming!

07:04.420 --> 07:07.220
Maybe I'll brush up on some
stuff, just in case.

07:10.230 --> 07:11.870
Onii-chan...

07:11.870 --> 07:14.440
How about I bump up your allowance a little?

07:14.440 --> 07:18.110
What?! Praise be to Mihari-sama!

07:20.410 --> 07:22.410
Onimai...

07:20.500 --> 07:22.420
ONIMAI

07:26.320 --> 07:29.750
Hey, Momiji! Can I copy your notes?

07:29.750 --> 07:31.830
Did you fall asleep again?

07:33.150 --> 07:37.670
Hang on, so I'm "Mahiron," and
Miyo-chan's "Miyo-chin," right?

07:37.670 --> 07:40.300
How come you don't have
a nickname for Momiji?

07:40.300 --> 07:42.110
That is weird, now that you mention it.

07:42.460 --> 07:44.080
Oh, that's right.

07:44.080 --> 07:47.010
You didn't go to the same grade school
as us, so you wouldn't know...

07:48.320 --> 07:51.530
I <i>did</i> have a nickname for her back then!

07:51.530 --> 07:54.440
It was embarrassing, so I asked her to stop.

07:54.440 --> 07:57.310
What? Tell us!

07:57.310 --> 07:58.680
I dubbed her...

07:58.680 --> 08:00.110
"Momijiro."

08:00.420 --> 08:03.070
Momijiro...

08:03.080 --> 08:05.530
Momi

08:03.080 --> 08:05.530
jiro

08:05.690 --> 08:07.370
It kinda suits her.

08:07.370 --> 08:10.020
It's 'cause I thought
she was a boy at first.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.090
I feel that.

08:12.090 --> 08:13.730
Come on, guys!

08:21.560 --> 08:24.480
Japanese 1

08:24.480 --> 08:27.400
Japanese

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Purrcy

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
ATK Magic

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Fire

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Lightning

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Defense

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Skill

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
1h Weapon Skills

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Dual Wielding

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Lost Quest 9 Strat Notes!

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Hero

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
1h Weapons – 2h Weapons

08:27.400 --> 08:30.320
Greatswords

08:30.310 --> 08:33.290
I should pick skills that
combo well with each other.

08:30.320 --> 08:39.520
Japanese 1

08:33.290 --> 08:36.540
First, I gotta awaken the
hero's power, though.

08:36.540 --> 08:39.790
But do I go for a strength or speed build?

08:39.790 --> 08:42.230
I wanna go home and get back to it!

08:45.500 --> 08:46.350
Hm?

08:46.660 --> 08:49.480
Maybe she has to go to the bathroom.

08:50.590 --> 08:55.510
Japanese 1

08:51.350 --> 08:54.240
Miss! May we go to the bathroom?

08:54.240 --> 08:55.520
Of course!

09:04.250 --> 09:06.370
W-Wait, what?!

09:12.850 --> 09:14.290
Seriously!

09:14.290 --> 09:16.630
You're so hard to read, Mahiro-chan!

09:16.630 --> 09:18.590
Aw, my bad.

09:18.590 --> 09:21.790
I was just excited to get back
and play the game I got.

09:21.790 --> 09:24.950
You know <i>Lost Quest IX</i>?!
It just came out yesterday!

09:24.950 --> 09:27.700
It's been so long since they
released the last one, you know?

09:28.130 --> 09:29.520
Gotcha!

09:29.520 --> 09:32.630
Sorry, I don't know that one.

09:32.630 --> 09:36.030
What?! You don't know <i>Lost Quest</i>?!

09:36.030 --> 09:37.490
I know it!

09:37.490 --> 09:38.510
You do?!

09:38.510 --> 09:41.050
Yeah, my big brother used to play it.

09:41.050 --> 09:43.800
Right, your big brother...

09:43.800 --> 09:46.720
Boys do love video games.

09:46.720 --> 09:47.810
Right?

09:49.060 --> 09:50.300
That's right...

09:51.130 --> 09:53.250
I guess we're all girls here.

09:57.630 --> 10:01.080
What do girls even talk about?

10:01.080 --> 10:01.610
What?

10:02.640 --> 10:04.480
Oh, no! I meant, um...

10:04.480 --> 10:06.530
Now that you ask...

10:06.530 --> 10:09.700
Just talk about whatever you feel like!

10:09.700 --> 10:13.100
You look so happy when you
talk about video games.

10:13.100 --> 10:14.320
I think it's cute!

10:15.780 --> 10:17.490
Asahi...

10:18.250 --> 10:21.180
You're such a good friend!

10:22.160 --> 10:24.560
Who's a good girl?

10:26.730 --> 10:29.250
Th-Th-That's...

10:29.250 --> 10:33.110
That's what I was gonna say!

10:37.890 --> 10:42.710
Though if you want girl talk, we
could always talk about romance!

10:43.190 --> 10:46.350
I have a feeling your idea of
romance is a little different...

10:46.350 --> 10:48.050
No way!

10:53.590 --> 10:56.280
Everybody's so sweet.

10:56.280 --> 10:58.370
Maybe I'll tell them more
about it next time.

10:58.730 --> 11:03.490
Truthfully, I'd like to have a deeper
discussion about this stuff,

11:03.490 --> 11:04.940
but that'd be asking too much.

11:04.940 --> 11:06.630
How far did you get?

11:09.080 --> 11:12.520
I think I saved right after
leaving the port town.

11:13.180 --> 11:16.100
Are you guys talking about <i>Lost Quest</i>?

11:16.460 --> 11:20.300
U-Um... Oyama, right?

11:20.300 --> 11:22.520
You play <i>Lost Quest</i> too?

11:22.960 --> 11:24.930
Of course I do!

11:24.930 --> 11:26.680
I mean, who wouldn't?!

11:29.140 --> 11:32.990
Oh, sorry for butting in and everything.

11:32.990 --> 11:35.010
No, we don't mind...

11:35.010 --> 11:36.320
Right?

11:36.320 --> 11:38.580
Y-Yeah. No worries.

11:39.470 --> 11:43.120
S-So, which companion did you recruit first?

11:43.120 --> 11:46.700
I got, what was it, that
one with the funny name.

11:46.700 --> 11:48.910
Do you mean Purrcy?

11:48.910 --> 11:50.630
Y-Yeah...

11:50.630 --> 11:53.420
Really?! Me too!

11:53.420 --> 11:56.510
I-Its defense is a little weak, though.

11:57.040 --> 11:59.160
Th-That's true.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.540
Yeah, true.

12:00.540 --> 12:01.950
That reminds me!

12:01.950 --> 12:04.420
Remember that enemy you encounter
in the first dungeon?

12:04.420 --> 12:06.540
That thing gave me the creeps!

12:09.910 --> 12:12.700
It's so much easier to talk to other guys!

12:13.460 --> 12:16.170
I'm so glad I found people
I can talk to about this!

12:16.170 --> 12:19.060
Oh! Which entry in the
series is your favorite?

12:19.060 --> 12:21.500
It's gotta be six, right? I love six!

12:21.500 --> 12:23.540
Huh? Six?

12:23.910 --> 12:25.810
Sorry, I haven't played that one.

12:26.070 --> 12:29.180
And you call yourself a fan?

12:29.180 --> 12:31.860
I mean, it came out before
I was born, you know?

12:31.860 --> 12:33.010
Before I was born...

12:33.190 --> 12:34.220
Before I was born...

12:34.850 --> 12:35.910
Before I was born...

12:35.910 --> 12:38.210
Before I was born, you know?

12:36.310 --> 12:37.610
Before I was born

12:40.400 --> 12:43.280
B-B-Before you were... born?

12:45.510 --> 12:47.190
What's wrong, Mahiro-chan?!

12:47.610 --> 12:49.660
Oh, nothing.

12:49.660 --> 12:50.880
I'm fine.

12:52.990 --> 12:54.850
The boys made her cry!

12:54.850 --> 12:56.190
You jerks!

12:56.190 --> 12:57.550
What?!

13:24.770 --> 13:25.750
Oh, right!

13:26.510 --> 13:28.670
Sorry for earlier!

13:34.690 --> 13:37.160
Oyama's pretty cool, huh?

13:37.560 --> 13:38.780
Yeah.

13:42.170 --> 13:46.050
Mahiro has leveled up!

13:48.550 --> 13:50.060
Onimai.

13:50.050 --> 13:53.430
Home Ec Room

13:53.640 --> 13:57.310
I love it when we get days
with more practical classes.

13:57.310 --> 13:58.880
Same!

13:58.880 --> 14:00.020
Okay, kids.

14:00.410 --> 14:03.580
Next week, we'll finally be putting
your baking knowledge into practice.

14:03.580 --> 14:05.750
Starting with cookies!

14:07.080 --> 14:10.150
The school will provide all
the basic ingredients,

14:10.150 --> 14:13.210
but discuss with your group if
you'd like to bring in your own

14:13.210 --> 14:16.250
to put your own spin on it.

14:16.250 --> 14:17.970
Let's go!

14:17.970 --> 14:20.110
I can't believe we get to
eat cookies at school!

14:20.110 --> 14:21.940
Gotta love those perks!

14:21.940 --> 14:23.580
We have to make them first, you know?

14:23.580 --> 14:24.500
Right...

14:30.540 --> 14:34.260
So what kind of cookies
do you guys wanna make?

14:34.590 --> 14:37.230
Are you good at baking, Miyo-chan?

14:37.230 --> 14:39.430
I love baking things!

14:39.430 --> 14:41.860
Wow, we have so much in common!

14:41.860 --> 14:44.080
I love <i>eating</i> baked things!

14:44.080 --> 14:46.890
Our team's gonna do great!

14:46.890 --> 14:47.920
Mahiro-chan...

14:47.920 --> 14:48.640
Hm?

14:49.450 --> 14:52.360
I'm sorry, but I wouldn't
get my hopes up just yet.

14:52.670 --> 14:56.660
Her heart might be in it,
but her baking's terrible.

14:56.660 --> 14:58.280
Oh, gotcha...

14:58.560 --> 15:01.700
There's so many choices, I can't decide!

15:02.260 --> 15:04.690
We gotta keep an eye on her.

15:04.690 --> 15:06.550
I don't wanna make her feel bad, though.

15:06.550 --> 15:09.460
Let's just gently nudge her
in the right direction.

15:09.460 --> 15:10.280
Yeah...

15:10.930 --> 15:14.660
Are you guys good at baking, then?

15:22.750 --> 15:25.410
What kind of cookies should we make?

15:25.800 --> 15:28.630
I'm sure we could just ask Mihari for help,

15:28.630 --> 15:31.060
but I don't know if that's a good idea...

15:32.420 --> 15:34.970
Baking is a science, you know?!

15:35.920 --> 15:38.380
Baking should be more about...

15:38.380 --> 15:41.760
fun and happy vibes, you know?

15:42.570 --> 15:44.650
Sh-She's so cute...

15:45.430 --> 15:51.060
Oh, in that case, why don't
we ask my sister to teach us?

15:51.370 --> 15:52.250
That's it!

16:00.140 --> 16:01.750
I'm home!

16:01.750 --> 16:03.800
Are you back, Onee-chan?

16:04.800 --> 16:08.030
I'm over here!

16:08.030 --> 16:09.920
Be a dear and help me up.

16:15.080 --> 16:17.770
W-Wait. Mahiro-chan's here?!

16:18.230 --> 16:20.850
Hey! You should text me before
you bring people over!

16:20.850 --> 16:23.200
I need time to make myself presentable...

16:23.660 --> 16:26.040
And this is the lazy-day look.

16:26.040 --> 16:27.810
Another facet to add to the list!

16:29.920 --> 16:32.140
You wanna bake cookies?

16:32.140 --> 16:34.330
We're gonna be baking
them in class next week.

16:34.730 --> 16:37.530
We wanted to put our own spin on it.

16:37.530 --> 16:41.070
In that case, I'm the girl for the job!

16:41.350 --> 16:46.280
I'll let you in on all my lit-tle se-crets.

16:46.720 --> 16:49.060
Thanks, Kaede-chan!

16:49.060 --> 16:50.840
Sounds kinda lewd...

16:51.150 --> 16:54.220
I gotta restore my honor somehow.

16:57.740 --> 17:01.160
Roufl

17:01.150 --> 17:02.500
Truth be told...

17:02.500 --> 17:06.110
I've always wanted to bake
cookies with my little sister.

17:06.110 --> 17:08.600
What? You could've told me!

17:08.600 --> 17:10.870
It'd be no fun if I had to
drag you into it.

17:10.870 --> 17:13.340
Oh, no, am I getting in the way?

17:14.160 --> 17:15.500
No way.

17:16.410 --> 17:19.090
You're a little sister
to me too, Mahiro-chan.

17:26.190 --> 17:30.010
This reminds me of the time
I taught Mihari how to bake.

17:30.500 --> 17:33.690
She would've been around the
same age as you are now.

17:33.690 --> 17:38.530
She was all excited to try making
cookies for her big brother.

17:38.530 --> 17:40.550
Now that you mention it,

17:40.550 --> 17:43.320
I do remember her baking
cookies a lot back then...

17:43.760 --> 17:47.200
She made cookies for us not
too long ago too, remember?

17:47.600 --> 17:49.980
I'm sure they tasted great.

17:49.980 --> 17:53.330
They say the secret ingredient
is love, you know?

17:54.150 --> 17:57.310
Imagining the joy on their face when
you give it to someone special

17:57.310 --> 17:59.560
might just be the key to good baking.

18:02.400 --> 18:05.970
Someone special, huh?

18:09.700 --> 18:12.560
Did you guys decide on what
our special spin should be?

18:12.560 --> 18:13.600
Yup!

18:13.600 --> 18:17.700
The results are in, and the flavor
of choice is black tea!

18:17.700 --> 18:19.280
Black tea, huh?

18:19.280 --> 18:21.460
All you have to do is add in tea leaves!

18:21.460 --> 18:24.900
Sounds fancy, too! I'm down!

18:25.370 --> 18:28.290
Roufl

18:28.850 --> 18:30.950
Let's get started, then.

18:31.410 --> 18:34.500
First, add the sugar and eggs
to a bowl of melted butter.

18:34.500 --> 18:37.260
Then mix well before adding the flour.

18:37.260 --> 18:38.800
Mixing!

18:39.330 --> 18:40.980
Now, add the tea leaves.

18:40.980 --> 18:42.910
Adding!

18:42.910 --> 18:44.730
Gently combine...

18:44.730 --> 18:46.580
Combining!

18:48.320 --> 18:50.800
Once cooled, roll out the batter, and...

18:51.060 --> 18:54.750
Now it's finally time
to cut out the cookies!

18:55.270 --> 18:56.510
Miyo-chan?!

19:01.270 --> 19:02.830
Safe...

19:03.590 --> 19:06.140
I've got the cookie cutters here.

19:06.140 --> 19:07.570
Great, thanks!

19:08.690 --> 19:12.250
We were about to have massive
cookies on our hands...

19:12.250 --> 19:14.990
She was so good at giving orders, too...

19:19.440 --> 19:21.320
Now all that's left is to bake them!

19:28.430 --> 19:30.900
All done!

19:30.900 --> 19:32.860
Whoa!

19:33.230 --> 19:35.450
They look like real cookies and everything!

19:35.450 --> 19:38.150
We didn't burn them either!
I think we did it!

19:38.390 --> 19:40.130
They look really good, too!

19:45.840 --> 19:47.730
Hurray!

19:50.060 --> 19:52.160
How did it go, then?

19:52.540 --> 19:55.040
Why don't you try one, Miss?

19:55.330 --> 19:58.610
Y-Your group made these,
did they, Murosaki-san?

20:01.870 --> 20:03.260
Goodness me!

20:09.090 --> 20:11.860
Homemade cookies are the best, aren't they?

20:11.860 --> 20:14.320
Not if you're the one making the—

20:15.810 --> 20:17.790
<i>Super yummy</i>! Right, Asahi?!

20:18.700 --> 20:19.670
Super...

20:19.670 --> 20:21.200
Here, try another one, Miyo-chan!

20:23.660 --> 20:25.060
So good!

20:24.370 --> 20:25.480
Right?

20:25.480 --> 20:26.820
Good, right?

20:29.750 --> 20:31.320
Welcome home!

20:31.610 --> 20:33.380
You made it through another day!

20:35.380 --> 20:37.500
Here, these are for you.

20:39.990 --> 20:42.550
Oh? Are these cookies?

20:42.550 --> 20:44.340
Yeah, black tea flavored.

20:44.340 --> 20:45.860
You like black tea, don't you?

20:45.860 --> 20:46.860
Right...

20:47.190 --> 20:48.310
I do.

20:48.860 --> 20:49.800
We...

20:50.230 --> 20:51.940
We made them in Home Ec today.

20:54.510 --> 20:56.350
<i>You</i> made these?!

20:56.760 --> 20:59.390
They're not as good as yours, though, okay?!

21:12.850 --> 21:15.050
Time to play.

21:30.030 --> 21:31.510
Gosh!

21:32.110 --> 21:36.840
These are just too precious to eat!

21:49.700 --> 21:51.800
Smells just like Earl Grey.

21:59.630 --> 22:00.840
They're perfect.

23:35.010 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode: Mahiro's First Girls Sleepover

23:35.010 --> 23:40.010
Illustration: Yoshimichi Kameda

23:37.860 --> 23:39.680
See you next time!
